{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-397",
  "title": "Why?",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Call"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I have a lot of side projects and I really need one to work, at this point in time. Tired of being in survival mode and wanting my work to reach people who really need it. I wanna solve real, painful problems and like you said I can't know what those problems are til I touch some grass and have some conversations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I really appreicate you grounding me about this."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To answer your question, yes the whole reason I started working on LD-C was because I have a deep-seeded hatred of the CSV format. I've spent so much time building parsers for web builder CMSs, product import scripts for excel -> ecommerce sites, needing a notion-esque datatable component for most webdev projects and having to re-invent the logic everytime, being underwhelmmed with Obsidian Bases and wanting to build something better, a love for JSON-LD and graph-based knowledge mgmt, needing a better way to describe spatial node-based interfaces, wondering why webflow doesnt support formulas, wondering why i cant disable a button if the users' cart is over a certain weight in any popular website builder even with api access, the need for a component library for using the same datatable components and primitives between many frameworks, needing something like this for my own personal finance (i refuse to use a tool someone else built to manage my finances), wanting to build a way for LLMs to express structured data in a more meaningful way, needing a DSL for describing agentic workflows, have always wanted to build smoething akin to WinFS that treats the filesystem like a semantic graph, the list goes on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I know that was a massive braindump–just wanna put it all out there to sort out together."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Response"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Thank you for the honesty.** This changes everything. You just revealed the real story, and it's actually **much more compelling** than any of the product ideas we've discussed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let me reflect back what I'm hearing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## The Pattern in Your Pain Points"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every single thing you mentioned has the **same root cause**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@type\": \"CoreFrustration\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"pattern\": \"Structured data that needs computation, validation, and transformation\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"manifestations\": ["
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"CSV hell → need schema + validation + transformations\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Excel → ecommerce → need mapping + computation + error handling\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Datatable components → reinventing state management + filtering + sorting\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Webflow formulas → need expressions + reactivity\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Cart weight limits → need rules + constraints\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"LLM structured output → need schema + validation + provenance\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Agentic workflows → need state machines + computation + audit trails\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"WinFS → need semantic relationships + queries + indexing\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"common_thread\": \"You keep building the SAME THING over and over in different contexts\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## What You Actually Need"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You don't need LD-C to be a financial modeling tool. You need it to be **the data layer you wish existed for every project**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const whatYouActuallyWant = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"the_tool\": \"A universal data + computation + validation layer\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"that_works_everywhere\": ["
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Frontend (React/Vue/Svelte components)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Backend (APIs, databases, workflows)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Desktop (filesystem, local-first apps)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"AI (structured outputs, agent state)\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"so_you_stop\": \"Rebuilding the same primitives for every project\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## The Real Opportunity: Infrastructure for Builders"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here's what I think you should build:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **\"LD-C Runtime\" - The Postgres of Computation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Not a product for end-users. **Infrastructure for developers like you.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@type\": \"ProductVision\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"name\": \"LD-C Runtime (working name)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"tagline\": \"Embed verifiable computation in anything\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"target_user\": \"Full-stack developers who are tired of rebuilding the same shit\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"use_cases\": ["
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"React component: <LDCTable data={model} /> → instant datatable with formulas\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"API endpoint: POST /evaluate with LD-C → get results + provenance\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"CLI tool: ldc validate file.json → check constraints\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Browser extension: Intercept forms, add LD-C validation\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Obsidian plugin: Turn notes into computable databases\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Webflow plugin: Add formula fields to CMS\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"LLM tool: Generate LD-C instead of unstructured JSON\""
        }
      ]
    },
