      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Write blog post about why you built it"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-222",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Post on relevant communities"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-223",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **Week 5-8: Watch What Happens**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-224",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If people use it: **you've validated demand**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-225",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If people contribute: **you've started a community**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-226",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If people ask \"can you add X?\": **you've found customers**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-227",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **Week 9-12: Decide**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-228",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on traction:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-229",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **High interest?** → Build more integrations, start charging"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-230",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Medium interest?** → Keep it as side project, find day job in space"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-231",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Low interest?** → At least you have tools YOU use, not a waste"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-232",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## The Real Question"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-233",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You said: **\"I really need one to work, at this point in time.\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I hear you. The pressure is real. But here's the thing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The projects that \"work\" are the ones you use yourself FIRST.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- GitHub started as internal tool"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Stripe started because Collison brothers needed payments"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Notion started as internal wiki"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-239",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Figma started because Dylan Field wanted better design tool"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-240",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Stop trying to guess what others want. Build what YOU desperately need.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-241",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-242",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## My Recommendation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-243",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Build the Obsidian LD-C plugin first.** Here's why:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-244",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **You already use Obsidian** (you mentioned Dataview frustration)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-245",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Obsidian community is active** (pays for plugins)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-246",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Clear before/after** (Dataview → LD-C Dataview++)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-247",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Fast to build** (1-2 weeks for MVP)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-248",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Immediate dogfooding** (you'll use it daily)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-249",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If the Obsidian plugin works, you've proven:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-250",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- LD-C runtime is usable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-251",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Developers want computable data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-252",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- People will pay for good plugins"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-253",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Then expand to React, Webflow, etc."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-254",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-255",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**So: Want to start with the Obsidian plugin? Or is there another integration you need more urgently?**"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}